    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d404-a4">

                <pb facs="0394" n="384" sameAs="frus:frus1941v06/pg384"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 4]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Armour</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Argentine Minister for Foreign Affairs</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Ruiz
                    Guiñazú</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1941-11-26"
                            >November 26, 1941</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: Although I am not authorized to make
                    a further commitment at present, I can assure you that it is the intention of
                    the Metals Reserve Company to exercise additional options on Argentine tungsten
                    production in excess of the 3,000 tons of ore or concentrates per year covered
                    by this exercise of option.</p>
                <p>I take this opportunity [etc.]</p>
                <closer>[File copy not signed]</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
